msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Ien kear ynfierd, fersifere bewarre en net wer te besjen. Lit leech om "
"OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY'] te brûken."

